  puppetry\, Autoretrato de Fridita tells the story of young Frida Kahlo wh
 o becomes inspired by her father’s creativity. With his support\, she us
 es her imagination and a box of paints to help her overcome challenges and
  create her own world. Adapted from Milagro’s original play Mijita Frid
 ita\, the production explores resilience\, creativity\, and identity.
